<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#194f45">
  <title>Would You Rather Generator - Chen Laoshi's Teaching Toolkit</title>
  <%- include('../partials/seo', { pageDescription: 'Build lively Would You Rather speaking cards from your own prompts, vocabulary, or saved word lists.' }) %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/site-theme.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/low-prep/would-you-rather/would-you-rather.css?v=vocabulary-library-3">
</head>
<body class="wyr-page">
  <header class="header wyr-header">
    <a href="/teaching-tools#low-prep-activities" class="back-btn">← Back to Teaching Tools</a>
    <div class="wyr-header-inner">
      <div class="wyr-header-icon" aria-hidden="true">🤔</div>
      <div>
        <p class="wyr-kicker">A QUICK CLASSROOM CONVERSATION</p>
        <h1>Would You Rather?</h1>
        <p>Turn paired ideas into bright, ready-to-present speaking prompts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="wyr-header-badge">Pairs · Prompts · Vocabulary</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wyr-main">
    <section class="wyr-intro" aria-labelledby="wyr-intro-title">
      <div>
        <p class="wyr-kicker">ONE PAIR, ONE CONVERSATION</p>
        <h2 id="wyr-intro-title">Build a deck in a few friendly steps.</h2>
        <p>Add your own either-or choices, select a question style, or turn a saved Vocabulary Library list into quick pairings. Then present, print, or export your slides.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="wyr-intro-tags" aria-label="Activity features">
        <span>Saved list ready</span><span>Print friendly</span><span>PPTX &amp; PDF</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wyr-workspace" aria-label="Would You Rather deck builder">
      <article class="wyr-panel wyr-template-panel">
        <div class="wyr-step"><span>1</span><p>Question template</p></div>
        <div class="wyr-template-layout">
          <div>
            <h2>Write the question once.</h2>
            <p class="wyr-help">Use <strong>{A}</strong> and <strong>{B}</strong> for the two choices. You can still edit each individual question below.</p>
            <label for="questionTemplate">Question template</label>
            <input id="questionTemplate" value="Would you rather {A} or {B}?" maxlength="90">
            <p class="wyr-sample" id="templateSample">Sample: Would you rather explain with a diagram or a table?</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="wyr-label">Common templates</p>
            <div class="wyr-template-grid">
              <button class="wyr-template active" type="button" data-template="Would you rather {A} or {B}?">Would you rather A or B?</button>
              <button class="wyr-template" type="button" data-template="Which would you choose: {A} or {B}?">Which would you choose?</button>
              <button class="wyr-template" type="button" data-template="Which is more useful: {A} or {B}?">Which is more useful?</button>
              <button class="wyr-template" type="button" data-template="Which is a better strategy: {A} or {B}?">Which is a better strategy?</button>
              <button class="wyr-template" type="button" data-template="If you could choose only one, would you pick {A} or {B}?">If you could choose only one…</button>
              <button class="wyr-template" type="button" data-template="Which is more interesting: {A} or {B}?">Which is more interesting?</button>
              <button class="wyr-template" type="button" data-template="For this task, would you prefer {A} or {B}?">For this task…?</button>
            </div>
            <button class="wyr-secondary-btn wyr-apply-all" id="applyTemplate" type="button">Apply to all cards</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="wyr-panel wyr-vocabulary-panel">
        <div class="wyr-step"><span>2</span><p>Vocabulary</p></div>
        <div class="wyr-vocabulary-layout">
          <div>
            <h2>Build your choices.</h2>
            <p class="wyr-help">Use one line per slide. Separate the two choices with a slash, vertical bar, comma, or Chinese comma.</p>
            <label for="pairInput">Pairs</label>
            <textarea id="pairInput" rows="7" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="pairInputHelp">explain with a diagram / explain with a table
read a biography / read historical fiction
work alone / work with a partner
show your answer in writing / explain it aloud
start with an example / start with a rule</textarea>
            <p id="pairInputHelp" class="wyr-small">Up to 30 prompts per deck. Example: use a model / write an equation</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wyr-vocabulary-actions">
            <button class="btn wyr-generate" id="generateDeck" type="button">✨ Generate cards</button>
            <button class="wyr-secondary-btn" id="appendDeck" type="button">＋ Add to deck</button>
            <button class="wyr-secondary-btn" id="shuffleDeck" type="button">↻ Shuffle order</button>
            <button class="wyr-secondary-btn wyr-danger-button" id="clearDeck" type="button">Clear deck</button>
            <button class="wyr-secondary-btn" id="addBlankCard" type="button">＋ Add one card</button>
            <button class="wyr-secondary-btn" id="loadExample" type="button">Load example</button>
            <div class="wyr-library-box">
              <p class="wyr-library-title">🗂️ My Library</p>
              <a class="wyr-library-link" href="/teaching-tools/word-list-library/word-list-library.html">Browse vocabulary sets →</a>
              <p class="wyr-library-description">Choose a ready-made Vocabulary Topic Set or one of your saved browser lists.</p>
              <label class="sr-only" for="librarySelect">Choose a vocabulary topic set or saved list</label>
              <select id="librarySelect"><option value="">Loading vocabulary sets…</option></select>
              <button class="wyr-secondary-btn" id="useLibrary" type="button">Make pairs from list</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="wyr-status" id="statusMessage" role="status">5 prompts are ready to preview.</p>
        <p class="wyr-editing-help">Click a thumbnail to change its offline icon or upload a photo. Each question can be edited on its own. Click a card to preview it below.</p>
        <div class="wyr-card-editor-heading"><strong id="cardCount">5 slides</strong><span>Editing each card</span></div>
        <div id="cardList" class="wyr-card-list wyr-card-editor" aria-label="Generated prompt list"></div>
      </article>

      <section class="wyr-deck-panel" aria-labelledby="preview-title">
        <div class="wyr-deck-toolbar">
          <div>
            <p class="wyr-kicker">STEP 3</p>
            <h2 id="preview-title">Preview your speaking deck</h2>
            <p>Choose a slide to edit it, or start presenting straight away.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wyr-deck-actions">
            <button class="wyr-secondary-btn" id="printDeck" type="button">🖨 Print</button>
            <button class="wyr-secondary-btn" id="exportPdf" type="button">↓ PDF</button>
            <button class="wyr-secondary-btn" id="exportPptx" type="button">↓ PPTX</button>
            <button class="btn" id="presentDeck" type="button">▶ Present deck</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="wyr-preview-area"><div id="slidePreview" class="wyr-slide-preview" aria-label="Selected generated slide"></div></div>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/tool-guide', { toolGuide: toolGuide }) %>

  <div id="presentation" class="wyr-presentation" hidden aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-label="Would You Rather presentation">
    <div class="wyr-presentation-bar">
      <span id="presentationCount">1 / 5</span>
      <button id="closePresentation" type="button">× Close</button>
    </div>
    <div id="presentationSlide" class="wyr-presentation-slide"></div>
    <div class="wyr-presentation-controls">
      <button id="previousSlide" type="button">← Previous</button>
      <span>Click a side to vote, then ask: Why?</span>
      <button id="nextSlide" type="button">Next →</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="printArea" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div id="artPicker" class="wyr-art-picker" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="artPickerTitle">
    <div class="wyr-picker-card">
      <div class="wyr-picker-heading"><div><p class="wyr-kicker">OFFLINE MATERIAL SYMBOLS</p><h2 id="artPickerTitle">Choose an image</h2></div><button id="closePicker" type="button" aria-label="Close image picker">×</button></div>
      <div class="wyr-picker-actions"><input id="iconSearch" type="search" placeholder="Search icons: book, sun, science, food…"><label class="wyr-upload-label" for="imageUpload">Upload a photo<input id="imageUpload" type="file" accept="image/*"></label></div>
      <p class="wyr-small">139 Material Symbols are included offline. Uploaded images stay in this browser for this deck only (3 MB maximum).</p>
      <div id="iconGrid" class="wyr-icon-grid" aria-label="Searchable icon choices"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer><p>© 2026 Chen Laoshi's Teaching Toolkit · Made with care for curious classrooms.</p></footer>
  <script src="/shared/wordlist-core.js"></script>
  <script src="/shared/deck-export.js"></script>
  <script src="/low-prep/would-you-rather/material-symbols-catalog.js"></script>
  <script src="/low-prep/would-you-rather/would-you-rather.js?v=vocabulary-library-3"></script>
  <script src="/javascripts/account-coming-soon.js"></script>
  <script src="/javascripts/milk-tea-footer.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
